# 🔴 The vault's master key, at any depth: a build context is sent whole to the daemon,
# and a `COPY . .` puts it in an image layer that every pull then carries.
**/*.key
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
.git
# The catalog submodule's pointer to `.git/modules`, and its own CI and scripts.
catalog/apps/.git
catalog/apps/.github
catalog/apps/scripts
target
web/node_modules
web/build
web/test-results
PLAN.md
